 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-06/match1711002date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进球大战！国米5-2罗马先赛9分领跑 劳塔罗复出双响 图拉姆1射2传</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.66" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260406/zhanbao_image_1711002_1775421021_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260406/zhanbao_image_1711002_1775421021_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260406/zhanbao_image_1711002_1775421021_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>劳塔罗复出即双响，<span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">国米5-2击败罗马，先赛9分领跑意甲！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-06/match1962056date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无缘夺冠！U16女足0-4日本获得亚军 2胜1平1负收官 日本女足卫冕</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260406/zhanbao_image_1962056_1775429616_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260406/zhanbao_image_1962056_1775429616_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260406/zhanbao_image_1962056_1775429616_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">U16女足0-4日本U16无缘蒙太古杯冠军，2胜1平1负收官。日本U16女足成功卫冕蒙太古杯。</span></p><p><strong>【其他新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-05/69d27149caf6anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">联赛三连冠！埃因霍温提前5轮锁定2025-26荷甲冠军，队史第27座</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/202604052229087361_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/202604052229087361_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/202604052229087361_1280.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">随着费耶诺德客场0-0被福伦丹逼平，埃因霍温29场积71分，领先第二名17分，提前5轮锁定2025-26赛季荷甲冠军，豪取联赛三连冠。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-06/69d2819656633native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">温布利开战！足总杯半决赛对阵：曼城vs南安普顿，切尔西vs利兹联</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260406/202604060307314643.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260406/202604060307314643.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260406/202604060307314643.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">足总杯1/4决赛战罢，曼城、切尔西、利兹联、南安普顿锁定四强。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-06/69d2d568a148cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">已是队史传奇！林德斯确认B席将离开曼城：希望他有个美满的告别</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-06/69d2d4e187f00native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：B席今夏将自由身离开曼城，他希望在世界杯前确定新东家</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.79" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260406/202604060536246620_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.79" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.79" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260406/202604060536246620_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260406/202604060536246620_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">曼城助教林德斯在曼城4-0利物浦的赛后发布会中确认了B席将在赛季末离开曼城的消息，随后罗马诺也跟进报道称球员希望在世界杯前确认下家。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-06/69d2bfe3eed9anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞CEO官方回应马丁红牌被取消：羞耻！VAR先入为主地引导主裁判</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d248579a630.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d248579a630.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d248579a630.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">马竞官方发布一则新的公告，其中首席执行官米格尔·安赫尔·希尔表达了对昨日进行的西甲第30轮，马竞1-2巴萨比赛中马丁的直红被VAR介入后取消一事的不满。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-06/69d2b5108f945native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">每体：马斯坦托诺成为皇马溢价买人典型 超6000万买入也面临外租</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251025/68fcdfedd3c26.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251025/68fcdfedd3c26.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251025/68fcdfedd3c26.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">《每日体育报》撰文分析了皇马对队内球员的未来规划，并表示马斯坦托诺或将面临被外租的命运。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-06/69d29bc5c4fd0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">神剧情！西汉姆联90分钟后连扳两球实现让二追二，将比赛拖入加时</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-06/69d29f971a0benative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">提前回家的有福了！西汉姆0-2落后时球迷纷纷离场，绝平后又回来</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260406/202604060146012790.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260406/202604060146012790.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260406/202604060146012790.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">西汉姆一度在补时连进两球，将比赛拖入加时。比赛进入补时前，部分西汉姆球迷已经提前离场；但西汉姆连进两球扳平后一些还没走远的球迷听到此消息又回来了。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-06/69d29b7d2b947native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：被喊“滚回摩洛哥，黑鬼”，亚马尔在客战马竞时遭种族歧视</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.39" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260308/69acaa101fe8b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; t